    "Condition : 1 - The proposed garages, hardstanding and parking bays, by reason of their design, position, appearance and due to the disproportionately large area of hardstanding required to provide adequate turning space, would result in the unnecessary loss of a large area of garden, and would be out of character with the pattern of development in the area. The proposal would fail to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of St Stephen's Conservation Area, contrary to policy ENV-B.1.1 and ENV-B 2.2 of the Council's Unitary Development Plan (December 2003)."
